  message: "Closed by PR #3604 (merged). Consolidation landed: _extras_components is the single source of truth (4 rows: grammars + gitleaks + embeddings + rust-analyzer). cmd_add_extras / cmd_remove_extras rewritten as thin loops over the table; --check and --skip migrate to add-extras (and --skip to remove-extras). cmd_install_extras / cmd_uninstall_extras and their argparse parsers are deleted; invoking either now exits 2. The rust-analyzer row's install function is wrapped through _install_rust_analyzer_with_bug06_gate (matches install-rust-analyzer's BUG-06 gate); its is_available predicate is _is_rust_analyzer_fully_available (binary AND integration package, so add-extras --check doesn't show misleading green ✓ when the binary is on PATH but integration is missing). test_install_extras.py renamed to test_extras_umbrella.py with rewritten table-driven test classes; test_gitleaks.py loses ~356 redundant lines of TestAddExtrasCLI / TestRemoveExtrasCLI / cmd_*_extras-in-TestVerboseOutput. Plan file: /home/jgstern_agent/.claude/plans/spicy-snuggling-panda.md"  # 1edb
